with open('WORKLOG.md', 'a', encoding='utf-8') as f:
    f.write('\n---\n\n## 2026-09-30\n\n### 🐛 Fix: Fallback for Salesman Visitings Total Km mapping on Unnamed Locations\n**Files:** `frontend/src/jsx/components/CommonMaster/SalesmanVisitings.jsx`\n\n- Fixed an edge-case bug where Total Km was returning blank for areas that failed to reverse-geocode their boundary names during polygon creation (saving them as "Unnamed Location").\n- Implemented a robust fallback mechanism that automatically cascades to a 1-to-1 sequential index mapping when the system detects that string mapping has failed.\n- This ensures that Total Km logic accurately calculates route distances even when the underlying `areaPolygonDistances` contains corrupted, generic, or completely missing location names.\n\n*Last updated: 2026-09-30 16:50 IST*\n')
